HIDFIDO_STRING(L"hid-fido2-age: cifra file e cartelle per più destinatari (formato age).\n  hid-fido2-age --new-key Principale [--profile destinatari.txt]\n  hid-fido2-age --new-key Riserva [--profile destinatari.txt]\n  hid-fido2-age --new-recovery [--profile destinatari.txt]\n  hid-fido2-age --encrypt FILE-O-CARTELLA [--profile destinatari.txt] [--output FILE.age]\n  hid-fido2-age --decrypt FILE.age [--profile destinatari.txt] [--output DESTINAZIONE]\n  hid-fido2-age --decrypt FILE.age --recovery | --identity chiave-recupero.txt\nSenza --profile si usa il profilo del gestore (%APPDATA%\\HID-FIDO2-WinLogon\\Files).\nLe cartelle diventano NOME.tar.age (un solo tocco per chiave). Il PIN si digita solo nella finestra di Windows.\nOpzioni: --rp-id ID (solo con --new-key), --language it|en.\n", L"hid-fido2-age: cifra file e cartelle per più destinatari (formato age).\n  hid-fido2-age --new-key Principale [--profile destinatari.txt]\n  hid-fido2-age --new-key Riserva [--profile destinatari.txt]\n  hid-fido2-age --new-recovery [--profile destinatari.txt]\n  hid-fido2-age --encrypt FILE-O-CARTELLA [--profile destinatari.txt] [--output FILE.age]\n  hid-fido2-age --decrypt FILE.age [--profile destinatari.txt] [--output DESTINAZIONE]\n  hid-fido2-age --decrypt FILE.age --recovery | --identity chiave-recupero.txt\nSenza --profile si usa il profilo del gestore (%APPDATA%\\HID-FIDO2-WinLogon\\Files).\nLe cartelle diventano NOME.tar.age (un solo tocco per chiave). Il PIN si digita solo nella finestra di Windows.\nOpzioni: --rp-id ID (solo con --new-key), --language it|en.\n", L"hid-fido2-age: encrypts files and folders for several recipients (age format).\n  hid-fido2-age --new-key Principale [--profile recipients.txt]\n  hid-fido2-age --new-key Riserva [--profile recipients.txt]\n  hid-fido2-age --new-recovery [--profile recipients.txt]\n  hid-fido2-age --encrypt FILE-OR-FOLDER [--profile recipients.txt] [--output FILE.age]\n  hid-fido2-age --decrypt FILE.age [--profile recipients.txt] [--output DESTINATION]\n  hid-fido2-age --decrypt FILE.age --recovery | --identity recovery-key.txt\nWithout --profile, the manager's profile is used (%APPDATA%\\HID-FIDO2-WinLogon\\Files).\nFolders become NAME.tar.age (one touch per key). The PIN is typed only in the Windows dialog.\nOptions: --rp-id ID (with --new-key only), --language it|en.\n")
